{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have strong evidence about Chigozie Obioma. Now let me reconsider the puzzle carefully.\n\nThe puzzle says the award was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" The Booker Prize was created in 1968. But the Man Booker International Prize was inaugurated in 2005 (the 2000s). However, Obioma's books were shortlisted for \"The Booker Prize,\" not the International Booker Prize.\n\nLet me reconsider. The puzzle structure: Book A is a contender for an award created in the 2000s. In the 2010s, the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won that award. Book B was released the preceding year.\n\nLet me check: The Fishermen (2015) — was it shortlisted for the International Booker Prize? Or maybe the puzzle refers to a different award. Let me check the Man Booker International Prize 2015 winner and whether The Fishermen was a contender. Actually, let me reconsider — maybe the award is the International Booker Prize, and Book A (The Fishermen, 2015) was a contender. The 2015 International Booker Prize winner... Let me verify the timeline and the \"born in same city where author of Book A grew up\" connection.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize 2015 winner László Krasznahorkai\", \"International Booker Prize 2015 shortlist The Fishermen Chigozie Obioma\", \"László Krasznahorkai born birthplace city\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ba060dad131b48aa94a4b166","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Chigozie Obioma grew up Akure childhood biography\", \"Chigozie Obioma early life Nigeria where raised\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_a470afab602d41009aef74e6","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789467573,"id":"chatcmpl-ec9b18e4-1abd-92e4-a5e2-5ff747b08f77","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20130,"completion_tokens":372,"reaso